  },
  {
    "start": 5.86,
    "end": 11.22,
    "text": "Imagine twenty million dollars in shares, securing a ten million dollar loan.",
    "speed": 0.98,
    "raw_duration": 5.975,
    "trim_left_seconds": 0.21,
    "trim_right_seconds": 0.405,
    "acoustic_threshold_dbfs": -66.02059991327963,
    "pause_after_seconds": 0.25
  },
  {
    "start": 11.47,
    "end": 20.67,
    "text": "At a hypothetical five percent simple annual interest rate, one year costs five hundred thousand dollars. No fees or repayments.",
    "speed": 0.96,
    "raw_duration": 9.775,
    "trim_left_seconds": 0.22,
    "trim_right_seconds": 0.355,
    "acoustic_threshold_dbfs": -66.02059991327963,
    "pause_after_seconds": 0.25
  },
  {
    "start": 20.92,
    "end": 27.98,
    "text": "Higher stock values do not erase the debt. Falling collateral can trigger a maintenance call and forced selling.",
    "speed": 0.98,
    "raw_duration": 7.675,
    "trim_left_seconds": 0.21,
    "trim_right_seconds": 0.405,
    "acoustic_threshold_dbfs": -66.02059991327963,
    "pause_after_seconds": 0.25
  },
  {
    "start": 28.23,
    "end": 37.2,
    "text": "Under United States rules, inherited property generally receives a basis linked to its value at death. Exceptions matter.",
    "speed": 0.96,
    "raw_duration": 9.6,
    "trim_left_seconds": 0.23,
    "trim_right_seconds": 0.4,
    "acoustic_threshold_dbfs": -66.02059991327963,
    "pause_after_seconds": 0.25
  },
  {
    "start": 37.45,
    "end": 45.68000000000001,
    "text": "Buy, borrow, die is the nickname. The debt survives. This animation demonstrates the mechanics, not a strategy to copy.",
